      "independent_derivation": [
        "Write B = Rj_*(E|_U). Rotating the triangle E -> B -> N -> E[1] gives N[-1] -> E -> B.",
        "Because Hom(K[-n], B[q]) vanishes for every shift q, the long exact Hom sequence gives Hom(K[-n], N[-1]) isomorphic to Hom(K[-n], E).",
