        "Condition (1) at a implies tau_{<=a-1}N = 0 and is implied by tau_{<=a}N = 0. Hence (1)_a implies (2)_a, while (2)_a implies (1)_{a-1}. The printed implication order is reversed because it relies on the lost shift."
